V P prove-instant-learning -> script why:"typed manual runner; stops at every judgement"
-- @record {"chapter":"learned-capabilities","data":{"failure":"Similarity, a draft, static lint or caller-supplied render measurements are mistaken for quality proof","recovery":"Keep escalation; require fresh rendering and independent calibrated evidence"},"key":"0","section":"pitfalls"}
X Similarity, a draft, static lint or caller-supplied render measurements are mistaken for quality proof -> Keep escalation; require fresh rendering and independent calibrated evidence
-- @record {"chapter":"learned-capabilities","data":"Frozen LAYA weights are unchanged. Sparse retrieval and original grammar composition are explicitly identified; uncalibrated areas abstain.","key":"0","section":"frontier"}
F Frozen LAYA weights are unchanged. Sparse retrieval and original grammar composition are explicitly identified; uncalibrated areas abstain.
-- @record {"chapter":"learned-capabilities","data":"Personal identity votes remain context, never quality labels. Rendered component novelty has not been rated by Paul.","key":"1","section":"frontier"}
F Personal identity votes remain context, never quality labels. Rendered component novelty has not been rated by Paul.
-- @record {"chapter":"learned-capabilities","data":"These same native tools are available to agents, App Factory and the taste loop. They never publish or execute generated code.","key":"0","section":"guidance"}
M efficiency "These same native tools are available to agents, App Factory and the taste loop. They never publish or execute generated code." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"learned-capabilities","data":"LAYA Instant: efficiency.laya_learn writes domain/input/label/source with layer personal and user paul for taste; efficiency.laya_query reads it, efficiency.laya_forget removes a source. Service callers use triage(task=manual-routing) with manual ID options, or verify(question=tool_outcome) with a toolId/result receipt and success/failure candidate, under the same selected workspace root. Explicit replay is not a statistical guarantee. Novel inputs use store leave-one-out scores, an out-of-fold agreement filter and a singleton cross-conformal set at nominal 0.95. Scores update on each write. This is empirical admission, not a selective accuracy guarantee; independently held-out families must measure at least 0.95 selective accuracy. Evaluation holdouts never enter neighbours, calibration or exact replay. Duplicate vectors do not multiply support. Image cold encoding is measured separately from warm text writes. Never convert author guesses into quality labels.","key":"1","section":"guidance"}
M efficiency "LAYA Instant: efficiency.laya_learn writes domain/input/label/source with layer personal and user paul for taste; efficiency.laya_query reads it, efficiency.laya_forget removes a source. Service callers use triage(task=manual-routing) with manual ID options, or verify(question=tool_outcome) with a toolId/result receipt and success/failure candidate, under the same selected workspace root. Explicit replay is not a statistical guarantee. Novel inputs use store leave-one-out scores, an out-of-fold agreement filter and a singleton cross-conformal set at nominal 0.95. Scores update on each write. This is empirical admission, not a selective accuracy guarantee; independently held-out families must measure at least 0.95 selective accuracy. Evaluation holdouts never enter neighbours, calibration or exact replay. Duplicate vectors do not multiply support. Image cold encoding is measured separately from warm text writes. Never convert author guesses into quality labels." src:"authored manual" state:verified
L efficiency.workflow v1 -- Executable efficiency method: chronological mechanism and measured quality
